fic clearance labels (e.g., \"10' Min Clearance\") provided between these lines and the proposed structures.\n\nThe plan clearly labels electrical infrastructure using leader lines with text such as \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\", \"**Electrical Pull Box**\", \"**Electrical Meters**\", and \"**Underground Electric Line**\" (denoted by the thick dashed blue lines), but it lacks specific dimensioning for required clearances from the overhead lines to these facilities."}]}
