ge Easement\"** (Located in the middle right edge; sub-text reads \"Doc. 2011021707 / O.P.R.T.C.Tx.\")\n\n**Wastewater:**\n*   **\"Wastewater Easement\"** (Located on the far upper left, outside the main property boundary line; sub-text reads \"Doc# [unclear]\")\n\n**Other:**\n*   **\"Sidewalk Easement\"** (This label appears twice along the far left edge of the drawing, outside the main property boundary; sub-text reads \"Doc# [unclear]\")\n*   **\"15' Easement\"** (Located on the middle right edge below a drainage easement; sub-text reads \"Vol. 73, Pg. 76 / P.R.T.C.Tx.\")"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fb743e7b-dade-42fe-a871-055cf9865568","uuid":"f69be617-10c1-460a-b72d-ba176552c529","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\" document, here is the requested information regarding easements:\n\n**Are transformer easements shown on this electrical design plan? Are any easements labeled around the transformer pad locations?**\n\nWhile there are multiple locations explicitly labeled **\"Electrical Transformer Pad\"** across the site plan (near Buildings 1, 2, 8, and 4), there are **no explicitly labeled \"Transformer Easements\"** surrounding these specific pad footprints. \n\nHowever, there is one electrically related easement near a transformer pad:\n*   Between Bldg. 2 and Bldg. 8, just below an \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" and next to \"Electrical Meters,\" there is a dashed rectangular area explicitly labeled **\"Vault Easement\"**.\n\n**What easements are visible (drainage, water, wastewater, utility, etc.)?**\n\nScanning the entire document, the following easements are explicitly labeled (transcribed exactly as they appear where legible):\n\n**Utility / Electrical / Telecommunications:**\n*   **\"5' P.U.E.\"** (Located along the top/northern boundary line curve; sub-text mentions \"Vol. 59...\")\n*   **\"5' Elec. Easement\"** (Located in the bottom center adjacent