{"level":30,"time":1778271785841,"pid":53120,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01HNUr3z3JAkx8kRw1VfmsLE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! I've successfully completed the site plan review for grouping 1 (Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines). The structured output has been provided with all the findings.\n\nLet me summarize what was evaluated:\n\n## Summary of Review:\n\n**Grouping**: EL-MD-EXP Group 1 - Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines\n\n**Project**: Valley View Townhomes, 3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX 78704\n\n**Key Findings**:\n\n1. **PASS (3 items)**:\n   - EL-1.1: Buildings maintain adequate horizontal clearance from OHE line\n   - EL-1.9: Fences maintain adequate clearance from OHE line\n   - EL-1.10: Fence posts maintain adequate clearance from utility poles\n\n2. **FAIL (4 items)**:\n   - EL-1.8: No dimension exhibits showing clearances from conductor to buildings\n   - EL-1.14: **Retaining wall on southern boundary only 1 foot from OHE line (violates 7.5-foot minimum)**\n   - EL-1.17: No section exhibits showing clearance from conductor to retaining wall edge\n   - EL-1.37: **Mitigation trees within 0.9-3.9 feet of OHE line (within 10-foot zone) with unclear species designation for utility compatibility**\n   - EL-1.46: 48-hour notification note is transmission-specific, should address all overhead distribution and transmission lines\n\n3. **NOT-VERIFIABLE (7 items)**:\n   - EL-1.2: No clearance dimensions on electrical design plan for transformers\n   - EL-1.3: No building elevation sheets showing projections and clearances\n   - EL-1.7: No surveyed conductor elevations shown on building elevation sheets\n   - EL-1.18: Driveway crosses OHE line but no section/profile views show vertical clearance\n   - EL-1.23: Dimension callouts missing on plans to verify measurement methodology (from conductor vs. pole)\n   - EL-1.27: Retaining wall in electric easement lacks clearance verification\n   - EL-1.31: No registered surveyor mid-span clearance data provided\n\nThe output includes all 14 items that are either FAIL or NOT-VERIFIABLE, with detailed evidence and reasoning for each finding. Pass and N/A items have been included as well per the user's instruction to emit all statuses.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6469,"cache_read_input_tokens":82170,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6469},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7795528a-4d8c-4fde-927d-805a3b7ab056","uuid":"e602656c-fd45-4f37-8d98-7f6e4ed87209"}
{"level":30,"time":1778271785841,"pid":53120,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01HNUr3z3JAkx8kRw1VfmsLE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Review Complete\n\nI have completed the comprehensive site plan review for **Grouping 1: Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines** for the Valley View Townhomes project.\n\n### Summary of Findings\n\n**Overhead Electric Facilities Identified:**\n- OHE line running along the southern and western property boundaries\n- Multiple 5-foot electric easements depicted on site plan\n- Utility poles marked at intervals along OHE routes\n\n### Key Deficiencies Identified:\n\n**Critical Failures:**\n1. **EL-1.14 - Retaining Wall Clearance**: Concrete retaining wall on southern boundary is only ~1 foot from overhead electric line, far below the required 7.5-foot minimum horizontal clearance.\n\n2. **EL-1.37 - Trees Near Overhead Lines**: Mitigation trees are positioned 0.9-3.9 feet from OHE line (within the 10-foot restricted zone), but their species are not clearly identified to verify utility-compatible status.\n\n**Missing Documentation:**\n- No surveyed building elevation sheets with conductor elevations\n- No section/profile views showing driveway vertical clearance to overhead line (driveway crosses OHE at south entrance with no clearance verification)\n- No dimension callouts on plans showing clearances from outer conductor to buildings/features\n- No registered surveyor mid-span clearance data\n- 48-hour notification requirement addressed only for transmission lines, not distribution facilities generally\n\nThe structured findings output has been provided with evidence citations and reasoning for each deficiency. All 15 checklist items have been evaluated (3 pass, 5 fail, 7 not-verifiable)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6469,"cache_read_input_tokens":82170,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6469},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7795528a-4d8c-4fde-927d-805a3b7ab056","uuid":"3d6431f8-e5b5-4fad-adef-84475e183818"}
