{"level":30,"time":1778271785842,"pid":53120,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01M6LRSvWJkKyFHErudcVTfT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the comprehensive site plan review for **Grouping 2: Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines (el-md-exp:2.md)**.\n\n## Summary of Findings\n\n**Review Complete**: 15 checklist items evaluated\n\n**Results:**\n- **2 FAIL** — Critical documentation gaps on landscape plan\n- **7 NOT-VERIFIABLE** — Cannot verify compliance due to missing cross-references between landscape and utility plans\n- **2 N/A** — Clearance measurement methodology cannot be evaluated (no measurements shown)\n- **3 N/A** — Transmission facilities/easements not present on site\n- **1 PASS** — Trees and overhead electric shown together on landscape plan\n\n### Key Deficiencies Found\n\n**EL-2.10 & EL-2.11 (FAIL):**\nThe landscape plan legend shows only functional tree categories (M=Mitigation, PL=Parking Lot, SY=Street Yard) without species identification. Neither the landscape plan nor plant schedule provides mature height information, making it impossible to differentiate large trees (40+ feet) that have special clearance requirements.\n\n**EL-2.1, EL-2.3, EL-2.6, EL-2.7, EL-2.8, EL-2.9, EL-2.15 (NOT-VERIFIABLE):**\n- Trees shown near overhead electric line lack utility-compatibility designation (UC per ECM Appendix F)\n- Large trees cannot be identified without mature heights\n- Pole locations and pad-mount equipment locations are not shown on the landscape plan where trees are positioned\n- Underground electrical infrastructure is not referenced on the landscape plan\n- Root barrier specifications are absent\n- No Austin Energy approvals are referenced\n\n### Primary Issues\n\n1. **No cross-reference between landscape and electrical plans** — Trees are shown on Sheet 31, but utility poles, pad-mounts, and underground equipment are only shown on Sheet 21\n2. **Missing species/height documentation** — Plant schedule exists but lacks utility-compatibility and mature height specifications\n3. **No clearance measurements** — No dimensions shown between proposed trees and any electrical infrastructure\n\nThe structured output has been submitted with complete details on each finding, including the applicable code citations, sheet references, and agent reasoning traces."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6824,"cache_read_input_tokens":61492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6824},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb7435c0-6e4e-4832-a8a2-cd00cbe522f8","uuid":"aed4dfb2-7bf9-49fe-8e27-749decee0293"}
